# IaC4: <type>(<scope>): <description>
#
# Types: feat | fix | docs | chore | refactor | test
# Scope: ansible | workflow | docs | terraform | openclaw | qdrant | traefik | baseline
# Max 72 chars, imperative mood
#
# Body: Why this change, what it enables, alternatives considered (P3).
# Footer: ref #ISSUE or closes #ISSUE
